  "This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "この端末のデコーダーがこのファイルをあきらめました。たいていは音声が原因です。Dolby (AC-3、E-AC-3、TrueHD) と DTS はシステムの WebView にライセンスされていないため、それらを含むリリースは音のない映像として再生されるか、まったく再生されません。AAC 音声の x264 リリースなら再生できます。",
  "This file has one audio track.": "このファイルの音声トラックは1本だけです。",
